# Lab: Forward Kinematics and Physics Simulation in MuJoCo

This laboratory project focuses on the implementation, visualization, and validation of **Forward Kinematics (FK)** for robotic manipulators using Python, NumPy, Robotics Toolbox, and the **MuJoCo physics engine**.

The project includes analytical forward kinematics for planar and spatial manipulators, numerical matrix-based implementations, and interactive MuJoCo simulations for robots such as the **Franka Emika Panda** and **UR5e**.

---

